==Battleground==
*4 [[Zigge]]s (200%) spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10.67~12.67 seconds<sup>320f~380f</sup>.
*8 [[Znache]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*8 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Zigge]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Zigge]]s (200%) spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**7 [[Zigge]]s (200%) spawn, delay 10.67~12.67 seconds<sup>320f~380f</sup>.
**2 [[Bore]]s spawn, delay 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The objective is to fight the Bores while dealing with as few [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]] as possible. The first thing you should try to do is to kill all the early ones before hitting the enemy base, so use [[Li'l Tank Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Tank Cat]] to get them to burrow, as he has the best chance of avoiding Zroco. Alternatively, a fast meatshield or [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Cleanerbot Cat]] will work too. Once they start to un-burrow, don't let them rest and use [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killers]] like [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Polevaulter Cat]] and [[Li'l Bird Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Flying Cat]] to finish them off. Once you hit the base, just hold off the first Bore with tough [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Reds]] like [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]], [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Island Cat]], [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] while you deal with the Zombies, then charge the Bore and kill him. Repeat and you win.

==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 11.5 Update|version 11.5]], the unlimited Zigges were set to spawn every 13.3~10 seconds instead of just 13.3. It didn't work properly because the maximum time was lower than the minimum, so in practice nothing changed.

